  "description": "Email enquiries only \n\nA spacious penthouse-level south-facing apartment in a desirable Churchtown location. \n\nThis well-presented two-bedroom fourth-floor apartment features a welcoming entrance hall, an open-plan living area featuring a stylish kitchen with integrated appliances, a living area which is enhanced with floor-to-ceiling windows and access to two south-facing balconies. The two double bedrooms are well-proportioned with built-in wardrobes, both with private balconies. The main bedroom benefits from an en-suite shower room. A large main bathroom and a shelved storage room complete the accommodation. GFCH, 1 designated parking space. \n\nLocated in the leafy, tranquil suburb of Churchtown, Hazelbrook Square is a beautifully landscaped and meticulously maintained development. Residents benefit from superb local amenities with the charming Churchtown Village, Nutgrove Shopping Centre and Dundrum Shopping Centre all nearby.\n\n Transport links such as the M50, local bus routes and the LUAS at Dundrum and Windy Arbour provide speedy access to the City Centre and towards Sandyford/Cherrywood. \n\nPlease email your enquiry with full details. Due to the volume of enquiries, it is not always possible to respond to all emails.",
